+* `UpperHalfPlane.natScale`: the scaling `τ ↦ N · τ` of the upper half-plane, an instance of
+  mathlib's action `UpperHalfPlane.posRealAction` of the positive reals.
 * `jN`: the function `τ ↦ j (N · τ)`.
 
 ## Main results
 
 * `jN_slash_invariant`: `jN N` is invariant under `Γ₀(N)`.
-* `jN_cuspFunction_meromorphicAt`: the cusp function of `jN N` is meromorphic at zero.
